Short:        2 Hawker Typhoons and 1 Heinkel 219 "Uhu"
Author:       Kris Elsen
Uploader:     Kris Elsen ping be
Type:         pix/3dobj
Architecture: generic

Scenefile for Typhoon&Uhu series of tracings.
To use this file: extract this file to the place you want and make an
assign to it as LW:

Example: Extract typhoon.lha to ram:
Directory typhoon with subdirs objects,textures and scenes will be created.

type assign lw: ram:typhoon and that is it!
Start Lightwave and load lw:scenes/land213+air and all should load.

This scene has textures for Typhoon but not for Heinkel 219.
I was also experimenting with the creation of landscapes in Lightwave.
This object is also included.
For a rendering made with this scenefile look at Typhoon9.jpg in
pix/trace
I hope you enjoy this scene. If so please let me know. I am also interested
in tips and tricks in the use of Lightwave so if you know one send it to me. 



